{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act24side_level_act24side_07_beg",
  "groupId": "act24side",
  "stageId": "act24side_07",
  "title": "锥心之刺",
  "storyCode": "CF-7",
  "avgTag": "行动前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act24side/level_act24side_07_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "8a9eeb04ab08d818ad91b7aa0de61c075f78f98de5d1c1e87044e8992a4716cd",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": "avg_1030_noirc2_1",
      "text": "嗬啊——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "学者猫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_752_1",
      "text": "喵哇！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "学者猫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_752_1",
      "text": "黑角！你差点砍到我了喵！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": "avg_1030_noirc2_1",
      "text": "啊，抱歉，俺还没掌握好这柄太刀的用法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "学者猫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_752_1",
      "text": "喵！这些家伙的样子比之前洞穴里的还要可怕。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "学者猫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_752_1",
      "text": "从体表的源石分布情况来看，它们的感染程度严重了不少，动作也非常急迫，简直像是在逃窜一样喵。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "学者猫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_752_1",
      "text": "你一定想问我为什么知道了这么多吧，那当然是因为我一直在观察被源石感染的生物喵......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "学者猫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_752_1",
      "text": "喵！你有没有在听我说话？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": "avg_1030_noirc2_1",
      "text": "救人要紧，俺去看看！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": "avg_1030_noirc2_1",
      "text": "您好？外面没事了，你在哪里哇？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "这里这里！来这边！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": "avg_1030_noirc2_1",
      "text": "呃......是这里吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "嗯嗯，就是这扇门。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": "avg_1030_noirc2_1",
      "text": "......没有任何东西挡在门前哦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "欸！怎么可能？我用了好多办法都打不开。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": "avg_1030_noirc2_1",
      "text": "要不，你试试把下面的把手提起来？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "嗯？是这样吗......啊！打开了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_761_1",
      "text": "竟然是这么打开的吗？难怪我没有找到。哈哈，真是奇妙的设计！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": "avg_1030_noirc2_1",
      "text": "你就这么被困了三天吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "没错，嘿嘿，或许是做观测的时候有点入神了，毕竟可是见到了了不得的东西......\n咦？脚下怎么软软的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": "avg_1030_noirc2_1",
      "text": "呃......因为你踩在源石虫的尸体上了......请问你是？"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "对不起哦，源石虫......\n啊，忘记自我介绍了，我叫泷居未来，是一名生态学者。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "学者猫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_752_1",
      "text": "黑角，她头上的角和你的不一样喵！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": "avg_1030_noirc2_1",
      "text": "未来......这是你的名字？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泷居未来",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_761_1",
      "text": "是呀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": "avg_1030_noirc2_1",
      "text": "俺们是罗德岛的干员，正在这附近执行任务，俺是黑角，这是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "学者猫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_752_1",
      "text": "喵！你是这里的学者吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泷居未来",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_761_1",
      "text": "当然，目前正在这片地方进行生态考察哦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "学者猫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_752_1",
      "text": "喵——我可以看看你的研究笔记喵？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泷居未来",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_761_1",
      "text": "欸......啊！会说话的小动物，你要干什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "学者猫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_752_1",
      "text": "喵呜！我不是小动物，我是艾露猫，也是研究学者喵！你看，我也有研究笔记。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泷居未来",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_761_1",
      "text": "哇，你把嘭草果实的爆炸瞬间画下来了，我超喜欢这个的，你知道它爆炸的原因是果实内液体的压力吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "学者猫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_752_1",
      "text": "我猜到了喵！是不是这样，随着果实的成熟，内部的黏液逐渐增多——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": "avg_1030_noirc2_1",
      "text": "喂！是俺救你出来的，理俺一下行吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泷居未来",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_761_1",
      "text": "哦，行吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": "avg_1030_noirc2_1",
      "text": "......为什么你会被困在这个矿洞里？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泷居未来",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_761_1",
      "text": "环境调查嘛，我可是学者欸。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": "avg_1030_noirc2_1",
      "text": "还有一个问题......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泷居未来",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_761_1",
      "text": "你等一下！我先说！我有一个超惊人的消息要告诉你们！你们绝对猜不到我看到了什么！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泷居未来",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_761_1",
      "text": "你们知道......在这矿洞里有什么吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泷居未来",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_761_1",
      "text": "一个——超级——大的！飞天怪物！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": "avg_1030_noirc2_1",
      "text": "......哦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泷居未来",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_761_1",
      "text": "飞天！怪物！还会喷火！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": "avg_1030_noirc2_1",
      "text": "......明白了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泷居未来",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_761_1",
      "text": "明、明白了？你们就一点都不兴奋吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": "avg_1030_noirc2_1",
      "text": "它叫火龙，俺们被扔到这里之前就趴在它的背上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泷居未来",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_761_1",
      "text": "啊......怎么会这样？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泷居未来",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_761_1",
      "text": "唉，太遗憾了，原来是已经被发现的生物，我本来想以最近看过的漫画角色给它命名的......害我白高兴了一场......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泷居未来",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_761_1",
      "text": "等等！会说话的小动物，我没见过你这样的生物，难道你是......新物种？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "学者猫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_752_1",
      "text": "你......你要干嘛！别靠这么近喵！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泷居未来",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_761_1",
      "text": "快让我好好看看！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": "avg_1030_noirc2_1",
      "text": "停一停，俺们先说正事，你和火龙有接触吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泷居未来",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_761_1",
      "text": "是啊，观察了好久，还做了它在矿洞中的行动记录，在源石环境中发生的变化，感觉一下子都没用了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "学者猫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_752_1",
      "text": "行动记录喵？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": "avg_1030_noirc2_1",
      "text": "源石环境？变化！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": "avg_1030_noirc2_1",
      "text": "你......哦不，请问你可以把这些记录拿给俺们看一下吗？这真的对俺们非常重要！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泷居未来",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_761_1",
      "text": "当然可以了，你们先过来等我找找。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "学者猫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_752_1",
      "text": "哇，食物和饮用水，照明设备，这是什么喵？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泷居未来",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_761_1",
      "text": "是源石防护设备哦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "学者猫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_752_1",
      "text": "......好齐全喵，难怪你能在这种地方撑三天。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泷居未来",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_761_1",
      "text": "当然啦，我还带了凉花草味的气泡水呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "学者猫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_752_1",
      "text": "黑角，有梯子喵，我们可以从进来的洞口逃出去了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": "avg_1030_noirc2_1",
      "text": "这里像是源石加工车间的入口，你是在哪里观察到的火龙？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泷居未来",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_761_1",
      "text": "沿着这个洞向前，火龙就在前方不远的矿井中。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泷居未来",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_761_1",
      "text": "你们进来的那个天井离矿场最近，只是离村子太远了才被弃用，现在倒是方便了火龙飞进飞出。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": "avg_1030_noirc2_1",
      "text": "你对矿洞很熟悉？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泷居未来",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_761_1",
      "text": "还行吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泷居未来",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_761_1",
      "text": "对了，给你这个。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": "avg_1030_noirc2_1",
      "text": "这是？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泷居未来",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_761_1",
      "text": "你们不是被火龙带过来的吗？我想同行的应该不止你们两个吧，应该是和朋友分散了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泷居未来",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_761_1",
      "text": "信号烟雾棒，可以从那边的通风管把烟雾放出去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": "avg_1030_noirc2_1",
      "text": "十分感谢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泷居未来",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_761_1",
      "text": "喏，数据都在这里啦，不过我写得比较杂乱啦，你们就一边看一边听我给你们讲吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泷居未来",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_761_1",
      "text": "火龙是四天前的晚上从天井飞进矿场的，那个时候洞内的采矿工人正在进行交接班，都被火龙吓跑了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泷居未来",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_761_1",
      "text": "它喷出的火焰引发了小范围的爆炸，进而导致了矿洞的部分坍塌，也就此封住了连接村庄的通道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": "avg_1030_noirc2_1",
      "text": "难怪会出现大量的活性源石粉尘......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泷居未来",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_761_1",
      "text": "嗯，它的情况也不算太好，环境中大量的活性源石似乎也对它产生了严重的影响，进食困难，性情暴躁。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泷居未来",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_761_1",
      "text": "我用仪器能观察到大量的源石粉尘悬浮在它的周围，它喷出的火焰会将源石粉尘引燃，产生极大的破坏力......幸好它没在矿场大肆破坏。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "学者猫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_752_1",
      "text": "喵！黑角，这就是火焰威力暴涨的原因喵！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泷居未来",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_761_1",
      "text": "啊，你们在外面遇到了火龙吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": "avg_1030_noirc2_1",
      "text": "不止一次......俺们正是为了处理它的情况而来，因为它的行动造成了源石粉尘向村庄的扩散。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泷居未来",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_761_1",
      "text": "我必须提醒你们，如果想要彻底解决它带来的问题，现在就是最好的机会。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": "avg_1030_noirc2_1",
      "text": "什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泷居未来",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_761_1",
      "text": "它现在非常虚弱，虽然恢复力惊人但需要时间，而我们的机会在于，矿场被过度使用，其结构非常不稳定。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泷居未来",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_761_1",
      "text": "只要将某些关键地方引爆，就能破坏整个矿场的结构，使其瞬间坍塌。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": "avg_1030_noirc2_1",
      "text": "俺有点担心火龙会到处喷火，那会导致源石活性化吧......在矿场里，后果一定会很严重。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泷居未来",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_761_1",
      "text": "是，但请相信我，只要按我的方法来，火龙不会有喷火的机会，很快就会被坠落的土石掩埋。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泷居未来",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_761_1",
      "text": "问题在于，我们现在人手太少了，无法及时在我标注的所有位置上做好布置。除非再多一个人，不然今天肯定是没法处理了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "学者猫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_752_1",
      "text": "如果夜刀来了应该就可以了喵。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泷居未来",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_761_1",
      "text": "是和你们一起来这里的同伴吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "学者猫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_752_1",
      "text": "是个很严肃但是靠谱的女孩子喵，她身边应该还有两只和我一样的艾露猫。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泷居未来",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_761_1",
      "text": "那人数应该足够了，但是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": "avg_1030_noirc2_1",
      "text": "但是？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泷居未来",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_761_1",
      "text": "关于火龙，我这里还存在一些疑问，或许会影响你们的判断。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泷居未来",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_761_1",
      "text": "你们可以看到我的记录，第二百三十七页，右下角那里。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泷居未来",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_761_1",
      "text": "我对它的掉落物进行了研究，发现它并没有感染矿石病，也就是说它的变化并不是由感染造成的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "学者猫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_752_1",
      "text": "没有喵？那它无法进食的原因是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泷居未来",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_761_1",
      "text": "应该也是源石的干扰，但并非感染。而且更奇怪的是，越来越多的源石在它的身上积累起来，甚至结成晶簇。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": "avg_1030_noirc2_1",
      "text": "俺琢磨一下......如果火龙没有被感染，源石可能不会永久留在它的身上，所以也许不会扩散源石粉尘？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泷居未来",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_761_1",
      "text": "理论上是这样的，但是目前还不能确认，况且......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泷居未来",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_761_1",
      "text": "火龙对待源石的行为也非常奇怪，不同于我了解的生物行为，实在是......很难描述。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泷居未来",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_761_1",
      "text": "我想你们有必要亲眼看看。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "学者猫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_752_1",
      "text": "喵！黑角，我们现在就出发！长怪角的学者哟，你能带我们下去吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": "avg_1030_noirc2_1",
      "text": "等等......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "学者猫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_752_1",
      "text": "哦，对，你才刚刚脱困喵。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泷居未来",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_761_1",
      "text": "我没问题的哦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": "avg_1030_noirc2_1",
      "text": "不是因为这个......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": "avg_1030_noirc2_1",
      "text": "通讯器——收到信号了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泷居未来",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_761_1",
      "text": "可能是这里信号增幅器的效果。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "学者猫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_752_1",
      "text": "喵，可以联系上夜刀了吗？赶紧告诉她这里的情况吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": "avg_1030_noirc2_1",
      "text": "等一下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": "avg_1030_noirc2_1",
      "text": "俺必须先把更重要的事情问清楚，关于你，泷居小姐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泷居未来",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_761_1",
      "text": "啊？我？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": "avg_1030_noirc2_1",
      "text": "你带着充足的后备资源，在火龙到来之前就孤身一人来到矿场中。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": "avg_1030_noirc2_1",
      "text": "你对这里如此熟悉，但工人交接班的时候你应该没有参与，不然也不可能被困在那里。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": "avg_1030_noirc2_1",
      "text": "凭俺对村民态度的观察，他们也不太可能放任一个外来的学者在矿场中随意调查。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": "avg_1030_noirc2_1",
      "text": "综上，俺对你的身份表示疑问。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": "avg_1030_noirc2_1",
      "text": "另外，你的姓氏......和露华村村长的姓氏是一样的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": "avg_1030_noirc2_1",
      "text": "你们两个有所关联，可你却毫不介意教给俺们破坏矿场的办法，也很乐意带俺们下去找火龙。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": "avg_1030_noirc2_1",
      "text": "泷居未来，你有什么目的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泷居未来",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_761_1",
      "text": "好吧，哎呀，本来也没想掩盖什么啦，知道是迟早的事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "学者猫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_752_1",
      "text": "喵，你真的骗了我们吗？我明白了，其实你根本......不是生态学者喵！你到底是什么人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泷居未来",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_761_1",
      "text": "我是如假包换的生态学者，证件齐全。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泷居未来",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_761_1",
      "text": "我确实有些事情没有告诉你们呢，比如泷居应是我的叔叔这回事，以及我是偷偷潜入了矿场这回事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泷居未来",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_761_1",
      "text": "我也知道你们是罗德岛来的，因为就是我留下了你们的联系方式，想必是火龙扩散的源石粉尘让叔叔他按捺不住，这才联系你们了吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": "avg_1030_noirc2_1",
      "text": "你留下的？为什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泷居未来",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_761_1",
      "text": "因为我想关掉矿场，在村里凭我自己没办法说服他们。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泷居未来",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_761_1",
      "text": "本来我就准备把你们喊来的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泷居未来",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_761_1",
      "text": "我想只要让你们看到了矿场里面，你们就会不惜一切代价带村民离开吧，可惜我的对外通讯设备被他们收走了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泷居未来",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_761_1",
      "text": "所以我就自己下来了，想要找个办法彻底摧毁这座矿场。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": "avg_1030_noirc2_1",
      "text": "你凭什么肯定俺们会让村庄撤离？俺们不一定会阻止矿场开采吧......而且，我还不知道你要摧毁矿场的理由。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泷居未来",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_761_1",
      "text": "理由就是，如果继续放任露华村深入开采这座矿场，这里很可能会遭遇......天灾。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": "avg_1030_noirc2_1",
      "text": "天灾！要多久？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泷居未来",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_761_1",
      "text": "目前还只是周边环境出现异常，具体时间很难说。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": "avg_1030_noirc2_1",
      "text": "所以之前在山崖边上会有你的名字，是你在调查这里的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泷居未来",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_761_1",
      "text": "是的。你们在那里应该有遇上分不清方向的状况，那就是异常能量场的影响。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泷居未来",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_761_1",
      "text": "坏消息是，异常现象在不断增加。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泷居未来",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_761_1",
      "text": "而现在来到这儿的大家伙，也就是你们说的火龙，尽管我没观察到它在巢穴里喷火，但它同样是个不稳定因素。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泷居未来",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_761_1",
      "text": "当然，如果按我上面说的方案处理的话是可以解决的，所有问题。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": "avg_1030_noirc2_1",
      "text": "可是为什么这里的矿场会导致天灾？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泷居未来",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_761_1",
      "text": "原因......你们看见就会明白。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工匠猫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_751_1",
      "text": "夜刀喵！在流血喵！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_1029_Yato2_1",
      "text": "应该是拦下火龙甩尾之后，摔在地上受的伤，伤口被碎石片堵住了才没有及时察觉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_1029_Yato2_1",
      "text": "从大腿内侧扎进去的......目前还不能判断伤口深度，得把碎石片拔出来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_1029_Yato2_1",
      "text": "你有可以治疗伤口的药吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "这个......\n不行喵，这个也不行喵。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_1029_Yato2_1",
      "text": "没事，工匠猫，那有能用作绳子的素材吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工匠猫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_751_1",
      "text": "有喵！把草放在一起，缠缠喵，编编喵！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_1029_Yato2_1",
      "text": "强度......应该够了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_1029_Yato2_1",
      "text": "你还有能燃烧的东西吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工匠猫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_751_1",
      "text": "捡到了喵！可以烧起来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_1029_Yato2_1",
      "text": "好，拜托你......烧起火来......这个给你......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_1029_Yato2_1",
      "text": "燃起火之后，把这把匕首擦干净，放在火焰上，可以做到吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工匠猫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_751_1",
      "text": "可以喵......但是你喵......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_1029_Yato2_1",
      "text": "呼......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_1029_Yato2_1",
      "text": "第四次语音记录，这里是罗德岛A4行动组......组长夜刀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_1029_Yato2_1",
      "text": "在先前与火龙的战斗中，我被迫与干员黑角分开，后续首要目标仍是追踪火龙。然而......由于我的受伤，行动暂时陷入停滞。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_1029_Yato2_1",
      "text": "本次任务中，我们遭遇了许多远超预期的困难，进展也并不顺利。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_1029_Yato2_1",
      "text": "......但我仍然相信，我们有完成任务的能力，尽管需要付出代价。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_1029_Yato2_1",
      "text": "现在准备开始伤口的紧急处理，我将通过录音来记录处理过程，以备任务后复盘应急处理流程......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_1029_Yato2_1",
      "text": "（深呼吸——）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_1029_Yato2_1",
      "text": "首先，应当取出插入体内的碎石片。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_1029_Yato2_1",
      "text": "呃啊——啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工匠猫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_751_1",
      "text": "血！血出来了喵！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_1029_Yato2_1",
      "text": "呼，呼......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_1029_Yato2_1",
      "text": "接着......用绳子扎紧止血......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_1029_Yato2_1",
      "text": "啊——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_1029_Yato2_1",
      "text": "呼，呼......伤口......可以看见骨头，但没有伤及动脉......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_1029_Yato2_1",
      "text": "......需要清创......刮去脏污......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_1029_Yato2_1",
      "text": "啊——嘶啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_1029_Yato2_1",
      "text": "清创......完成，然后......为确保接下来的行动顺利进行，我需要保持活动能力。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_1029_Yato2_1",
      "text": "在缺少药品和包扎绷带的情况下......决定使用......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_1029_Yato2_1",
      "text": "工匠猫，好了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工匠猫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_751_1",
      "text": "好了喵。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_1029_Yato2_1",
      "text": "灼烧......用于封闭伤口，记录结束。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_1029_Yato2_1",
      "text": "刀给我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_1029_Yato2_1",
      "text": "（深呼吸——）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_1029_Yato2_1",
      "text": "（刀按在伤口边缘）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_1029_Yato2_1",
      "text": "啊——啊——啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_1029_Yato2_1",
      "text": "啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工匠猫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_751_1",
      "text": "夜刀！夜刀喵！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_1029_Yato2_1",
      "text": "......我......我没事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_1029_Yato2_1",
      "text": "伤口......好，血止住了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工匠猫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_751_1",
      "text": "那边喵！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_1029_Yato2_1",
      "text": "信号烟雾？是黑角他们放出来的吗？和随从艾露猫指出的方向一致，他们应该已经到了火龙那边，没事就好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_1029_Yato2_1",
      "text": "天色......时间应该快到早晨了，怎么还这么昏暗？黑色的云层......嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_1029_Yato2_1",
      "text": "什么声音？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工匠猫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_751_1",
      "text": "森林！轰隆隆地在震动喵！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_1029_Yato2_1",
      "text": "这声音，是野兽！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工匠猫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_751_1",
      "text": "那边！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_1029_Yato2_1",
      "text": "森林里的野兽暴动了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_1029_Yato2_1",
      "text": "如此多的野兽倾巢而出......它们是预感到什么了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_761_1",
      "text": "救命！救救我们！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_1029_Yato2_1",
      "text": "有人在呼救！我们过去！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焦躁的村民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "*东国粗口*，怎么突然出来那么多野兽啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胆小的村民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我就说不该听村长的命令现在进森林，就是几个外人而已......救命啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焦躁的村民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "别喊了！这破林子里能有人吗？再不想办法都得死这儿！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_1029_Yato2_1",
      "text": "村子里的人？你们怎么在这里？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胆小的村民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你看！喊两声还是有用的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_1029_Yato2_1",
      "text": "快跟我走，我带你们出去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焦躁的村民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "能去那边吗？去那里我们就能前往避得开野兽的地方了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_1029_Yato2_1",
      "text": "应该可以。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_1029_Yato2_1",
      "text": "到了，这里野兽暂时没有过来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胆小的村民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "嗯？你们......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胆小的村民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "他们！他们就是村长让我们找的外人，他们果然还活着！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_1029_Yato2_1",
      "text": "找我们？村长？他派你们来的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焦躁的村民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "这战斗力......难怪未来那姑娘留了罗德岛的联系方式，说那上面都不是一般人哩。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焦躁的村民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "是村长喊我们来的，他说你们可能没有被坍塌的洞穴困住，让我们在山上寻找你们的踪迹，如果发现了你们......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焦躁的村民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "就带你们下山，离开村子，越远越好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_1029_Yato2_1",
      "text": "他为什么要这么做？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胆小的村民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "啊，别说了！野兽也要来这边了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_1029_Yato2_1",
      "text": "野兽的数量又增加了，这样下去......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_1029_Yato2_1",
      "text": "可恶，是我的错，让柏生先生一个人走了，虽然随从艾露猫跟了上去，可现在的情况......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_1029_Yato2_1",
      "text": "你们两个能自己去到安全的地方吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焦躁的村民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "从这里走的话应该没问题。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_1029_Yato2_1",
      "text": "抱歉，我不能继续护卫你们，请注意安全，如果能回到村子的话麻烦尽快通知居民撤离！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焦躁的村民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "明白，还有......谢谢你们。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_1029_Yato2_1",
      "text": "工匠猫，我们得去帮助柏生先生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工匠猫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_751_1",
      "text": "喵，黑角喵。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_1029_Yato2_1",
      "text": "......嗯，黑角他们还在火龙那边，我也得把行动计划同步给他，但是现在时间......不允许。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "通讯器",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "嘟嘟——嘟嘟——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工匠猫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_751_1",
      "text": "喵，通讯器响了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_1029_Yato2_1",
      "text": "是黑角，幸好恢复通讯了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "夜刀，你能听到吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_1029_Yato2_1",
      "text": "我在。我看到信号烟雾了，是你们吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "是的，俺现在和学者猫在一起，俺们暂时安全，你怎么样？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_1029_Yato2_1",
      "text": "我......我还好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_1029_Yato2_1",
      "text": "黑角，你知道现在外面的情况吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "天灾的前兆，是吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_1029_Yato2_1",
      "text": "嗯，已经出现了一些明显的异象，看情形，撤离村民的时间应该还充裕，可森林里的野兽已经因此开始暴动了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_1029_Yato2_1",
      "text": "黑角，我必须将我即将展开的行动与你同步。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_1029_Yato2_1",
      "text": "不久前......我犯了一个错误，和柏生先生发生了冲突，放任柏生先生一个人离开了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_1029_Yato2_1",
      "text": "现在的情形下，他的情况可能非常危险，我的判断是......我应该优先去救他，而不是和你们会合。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_1029_Yato2_1",
      "text": "解决火龙威胁的办法尚不明确，但柏生先生很可能会就此丧命。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_1029_Yato2_1",
      "text": "这是我造成的，我绝对不能抛下他不管。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "俺理解，但是，俺也有个情况必须传达给你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_1029_Yato2_1",
      "text": "......是什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "俺们当前正位于火龙所处位置的上方，也确定了这里和村中洞穴相连......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "一座源石矿场，火龙正是从这里带出了活性源石。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_1029_Yato2_1",
      "text": "竟然是源石矿场。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "而且......彻底解决火龙的办法，俺们也找到了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_1029_Yato2_1",
      "text": "啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "毁掉整座矿场，将火龙埋在废墟中，能够一劳永逸地解决火龙本身，以及其可能会传播矿石病的威胁，让村庄没有后顾之忧地撤离。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_1029_Yato2_1",
      "text": "确认可行？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "嗯，是对矿场有深入研究的人制定的方案。但现在要即刻完成这件事，只靠俺和学者猫是做不到的，人手不够，俺们需要你的帮助。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "如果错过了这次机会，后面很可能会有变故。最坏的情况......俺们将遭遇前所未有的危机。俺们需要你做出决定。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_1029_Yato2_1",
      "text": "......明白。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "夜刀......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_1029_Yato2_1",
      "text": "真是个难题......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "夜刀，再听俺说一句话。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "记得俺们做过的决定吗？那个时候俺们就已经做出选择了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_1029_Yato2_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_1029_Yato2_1",
      "text": "废话......我又没说我做不到。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_1029_Yato2_1",
      "text": "决定不会改变，我马上就出发去找柏生先生，那边的情况你们尽力控制。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_1029_Yato2_1",
      "text": "柏生先生的性命我会救下，火龙也休想对任何人造成伤害。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_1029_Yato2_1",
      "text": "我会救下所有人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "注意安全。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_1029_Yato2_1",
      "text": "你也是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏生义冈",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_755_1",
      "text": "死！死啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏生义冈",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_755_1",
      "text": "你们都给我滚！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏生义冈",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_755_1",
      "text": "臭小子......到底为什么......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏生明",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_760_1",
      "text": "老东西，不要拦着我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏生义冈",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_755_1",
      "text": "没脑子的东西！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏生义冈",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_755_1",
      "text": "一群猎人......都不懂得尊重森林的规矩，让森林里好些日子都不消停，耕地也被受惊的畜生糟蹋了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏生义冈",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_755_1",
      "text": "现在好了，这是他们的报应！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏生明",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_760_1",
      "text": "他们只带了挖矿的工具进去，要对付那么多野兽几乎不可能。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏生明",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_760_1",
      "text": "我......必须要进森林，不能眼睁睁地看着兽潮袭击他们。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏生义冈",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_755_1",
      "text": "你不是也反对开采源石吗？那不是正好吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏生义冈",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_755_1",
      "text": "森林里那些家伙是他们自找的！就让他们被野兽吃了就好！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏生明",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_760_1",
      "text": "老东西，我是村里的猎人，唯独我不能在此时沉默。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏生义冈",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_755_1",
      "text": "蠢货，混蛋，臭小子！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏生义冈",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_755_1",
      "text": "你敢出这个门，我就打断你的腿！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏生明",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_760_1",
      "text": "结果那时你还是没拦住我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏生明",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_760_1",
      "text": "所以我才会在那里变成那个模样。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏生义冈",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_755_1",
      "text": "是的，是我，都是我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏生义冈",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_755_1",
      "text": "是我害你死去的......都怪我，我不是个称职的父亲。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏生明",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_760_1",
      "text": "你该愧疚，愧疚自己的无能。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏生明",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_760_1",
      "text": "你该偿还，偿还这份罪孽。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏生义冈",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_755_1",
      "text": "是的，我该偿还，我是想为你杀死所有的野兽，为你复仇。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏生义冈",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_755_1",
      "text": "那头，那头最庞大的、最邪恶的、最疯狂的怪物，喷火的怪物！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏生义冈",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_755_1",
      "text": "......可我做不到了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏生义冈",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_755_1",
      "text": "我这双手老得拿不起矛，我这双眼睛浑浊到只能眼看着畜生扑来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏生明",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_760_1",
      "text": "那你只能去死了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏生义冈",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_755_1",
      "text": "我只能去死了，对，只能是这样。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏生义冈",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_755_1",
      "text": "杀一只，再杀一只。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏生义冈",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_755_1",
      "text": "然后......我就能来见你了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "想要挥动狩猎矛。\n但是手臂已经没有力气了，任由矛摔落在地。\n不想拾起，失去意义。\n野兽露出森森的獠牙，它将要撕开束手就擒的猎物。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏生义冈",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_755_1",
      "text": "哈，被挡住了......一头身披鳞甲的野兽......没见过。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏生义冈",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_755_1",
      "text": "这个时候了，野兽还在互相撕咬。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏生义冈",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_755_1",
      "text": "我就要死在这些畜生的爪牙之下了吗......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "随从艾露猫",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "夜刀阁下，请想清楚，这种情况下进去了不一定能够出来喵。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏生义冈",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_755_1",
      "text": "又是什么......声音？是谁......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_1029_Yato2_1",
      "text": "你只用告诉我，有什么办法可以送我进去，或者我自己杀进去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏生义冈",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_755_1",
      "text": "在说话......是错觉吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_1029_Yato2_1",
      "text": "老东西，还不是你死的时候。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏生义冈",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_755_1",
      "text": "啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏生义冈",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_755_1",
      "text": "女娃子，你为什么还要来这里？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_1029_Yato2_1",
      "text": "来救你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏生义冈",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_755_1",
      "text": "你该走的，你不该救我！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_1029_Yato2_1",
      "text": "别*东国粗口*废话！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_1029_Yato2_1",
      "text": "不是你口口声声地说要讨伐火龙的吗？你现在面对着一群连名字都叫不上来的野兽！你情愿就这么死掉吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_1029_Yato2_1",
      "text": "睁大眼睛看看眼前的状况！发疯的野兽迟早会冲下山去，首先袭击的就是村庄......平日熟悉的人们四散逃亡，落单的孩子会死去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_1029_Yato2_1",
      "text": "你要眼睁睁地看着这些情景发生吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_1029_Yato2_1",
      "text": "柏生义冈，你是露华村的猎人，唯一的猎人，唯独你不可沉默。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_1029_Yato2_1",
      "text": "你最不应该做的就是在这里自怨自艾，更没有资格放弃你的生命。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_1029_Yato2_1",
      "text": "握住你手中的矛，抛弃那些无用的执念，好好想想猎人该做什么！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_1029_Yato2_1",
      "text": "是从野兽的利爪下保卫家园，是要拼命带来生存的火种！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_1029_Yato2_1",
      "text": "总有该为生存承担代价的人......猎人、还有我们......都选择了这条道路。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_1029_Yato2_1",
      "text": "起来啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏生义冈",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_755_1",
      "text": "明......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏生义冈",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_755_1",
      "text": "当时你说了什么，我没能拦住你......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏生明",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_760_1",
      "text": "我说，我一定会战胜它们的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏生义冈",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_755_1",
      "text": "你做到了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏生明",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_760_1",
      "text": "父亲，我做到了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏生义冈",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_755_1",
      "text": "明......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏生义冈",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_755_1",
      "text": "臭小子，你的矛很好用，我得握紧才行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏生义冈",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_755_1",
      "text": "快走吧，不要再出现在我面前了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏生义冈",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_755_1",
      "text": "我会战胜它们。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏生义冈",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_755_1",
      "text": "别吵了......吵得很。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏生义冈",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_755_1",
      "text": "你这女娃子，平时话不多，说起来嘴巴比裂兽还要狠......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_1029_Yato2_1",
      "text": "还有力气？那就抓紧时间，你去守好背后。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏生义冈",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_755_1",
      "text": "我不需要听一个后辈的指挥......管好你自己。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "随从艾露猫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_750_1",
      "text": "刚刚阁下说的话，真让老夫想起了彼时在可可特村的时光喵。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "随从艾露猫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_750_1",
      "text": "在“猎人”尚未出现的岁月里，正是村长首先挺身而出喵，为了村庄的安全讨伐怪物，以英勇的姿态获得了“英雄”的称号......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "随从艾露猫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_750_1",
      "text": "喵！不要抓着老夫的脖子拎起来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_1029_Yato2_1",
      "text": "随从艾露猫，你去看好右边。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "随从艾露猫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_750_1",
      "text": "夜刀阁下，刚才老夫说与阁下的那几招你都记住了喵？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_1029_Yato2_1",
      "text": "呃，在脑海里过了几遍。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "随从艾露猫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_750_1",
      "text": "阁下须切记喵，使用双剑的诀窍即是——进入如凶兽一般，舍弃防守的状态。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "随从艾露猫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_750_1",
      "text": "我们称之为，“鬼人化”......喵。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_1029_Yato2_1",
      "text": "“鬼人化”吗......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_1029_Yato2_1",
      "text": "二位，我们上了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
